      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Portal",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "001:L2",
      "event_id": "001",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 09:58:12 UTC",
      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "- **From:** Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "start": 22,
      "end": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "001:L3",
      "event_id": "001",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 09:58:12 UTC",
      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 55,
      "end": 115
    },
    {
      "id": "001:L5",
      "event_id": "001",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 09:58:12 UTC",
      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "Reported that the smoke alarm had come away from the ceiling and needed attention. No photographs or other attachments were supplied.",
      "start": 117,
      "end": 250
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L1",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 10:21:14 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L2",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 10:21:14 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L3",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 10:21:14 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 114
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L5",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 10:21:14 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Acknowledged request NBL-016 and said the agency would check the repair arrangements with the landlord before confirming next steps.",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 248
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L1",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 11:24:38 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L2",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 11:24:38 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L3",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 11:24:38 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Ronan Vale (Landlord)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 115
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L5",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 11:24:38 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Said an inspection had noted that the alarm had been put up recently and had come down. The agency had no record of arranging that installation. Asked whether the landlord had arranged it and whether the installer could return to secure it.",
      "start": 117,
      "end": 357
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L1",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 16:14:57 UTC",
      "sender": "Ronan Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L2",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 16:14:57 UTC",
      "sender": "Ronan Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Ronan Vale (Landlord)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L3",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 16:14:57 UTC",
      "sender": "Ronan Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 55,
      "end": 115
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L5",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 16:14:57 UTC",
      "sender": "Ronan Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Replied briefly that they would use their own electrician to have a look. No electrician's name, work scope, or visit date was provided.",
      "start": 117,
      "end": 253
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L1",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 16:55:25 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L2",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 16:55:25 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L3",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 16:55:25 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Ronan Vale (Landlord)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 115
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L5",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 16:55:25 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Acknowledged that the landlord would arrange the work and asked for an expected completion date and confirmation once it was finished.",
      "start": 117,
      "end": 251
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L1",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 16:55:33 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L2",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 16:55:33 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L3",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 16:55:33 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 114
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L5",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-07 16:55:33 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Advised that the landlord intended to arrange an electrician and that visit timing should be agreed with the tenant. Asked the tenant to contact the agency if there were safety concerns.",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 302
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L1",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-12 05:55:15 UTC",
      "sender": "Ronan Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L2",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-12 05:55:15 UTC",
      "sender": "Ronan Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Ronan Vale (Landlord)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L3",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-12 05:55:15 UTC",
      "sender": "Ronan Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 55,
      "end": 115
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L5",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-12 05:55:15 UTC",
      "sender": "Ronan Vale (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Said the electrician would contact the tenant and complete the work by the following weekend at the latest. No contractor details or confirmed appointment were included.",
      "start": 117,
      "end": 286
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L1",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-24 08:01:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L2",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-24 08:01:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L3",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-24 08:01:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 114
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L5",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-24 08:01:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Asked whether the alarm had been reattached and whether anyone had contacted the tenant. The agency still had no completion confirmation.",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 253
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L1",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-27 09:25:40 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L2",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-27 09:25:40 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L3",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-27 09:25:40 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 113
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L5",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-27 09:25:40 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Tenant said the landlord had not yet fixed the alarm and that work was expected on Sunday, 31 August. The call did not establish who had confirmed that date or whether a timed appointment was arranged.",
      "start": 115,
      "end": 316
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L1",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 15:50:40 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L2",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 15:50:40 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L3",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 15:50:40 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 113
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L5",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 15:50:40 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Tenant said a fitter, not the landlord, had attended, removed the bracket, and could not refit the alarm because the box had no bracket in it. The alarm remained unmounted. Tenant thought the fitter might return the following day, but no appointment was confirmed.",
      "start": 115,
      "end": 379
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L1",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 16:50:26 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L2",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 16:50:26 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L3",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 16:50:26 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 113
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L5",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 16:50:26 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Tenant said they were in hospital and did not wish to speak. No maintenance details were discussed during the call.",
      "start": 115,
      "end": 230
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L1",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 16:57:08 UTC",
      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L2",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 16:57:08 UTC",
      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 53
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L3",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 16:57:08 UTC",
      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 54,
      "end": 114
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L5",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 16:57:08 UTC",
      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Confirmed that the alarm work was not finished. Tenant said the fitter had been due on Sunday, but they had been admitted to hospital on Friday. They expected to arrange it when home and said they would email once it was done; for now they needed to recover.",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 374
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L1",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 13:12:26 UTC",
      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L2",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 13:12:26 UTC",
      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 53
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L3",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 13:12:26 UTC",
      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 54,
      "end": 114
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L5",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 13:12:26 UTC",
      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Said the fitter had still not completed the alarm and that they had just been discharged from hospital. Tenant said they would arrange it and report when complete, and asked the agency to leave them alone for the moment because repeated calls and emails while they were ill had been upsetting.",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 409
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L1",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 17:40:27 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Note",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L2",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 17:40:27 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L3",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 17:40:27 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **To:** Dorian Pike (Maintenance Operations Lead, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 156
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L5",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 17:40:27 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "Recorded a pause in tenant contact in response to the tenant's request while they recovered. There was no evidence on file that the alarm had been mounted or tested.",
      "start": 158,
      "end": 323
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L1",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-20 10:15:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L2",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-20 10:15:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L3",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-20 10:15:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 53,
      "end": 113
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L5",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-20 10:15:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Elise Rowan (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Reported an unannounced person knocking at the property on Saturday morning and saying they were there to check something. Tenant did not let the person in because they could not verify who they were and thought it might be a scam. Tenant was unsure whether the visitor was connected to the alarm work.",
      "start": 115,
      "end": 417
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L1",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-20 11:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Note",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L2",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-20 11:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L3",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-20 11:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **To:** Dorian Pike (Maintenance Operations Lead, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 156
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L5",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-20 11:02:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "Recorded the tenant's account that they had previously raised the unexpected knock with another agency contact, who said it had been passed to a building-management contact. The visitor's identity, organization, purpose, and authority have not been verified in this case.",
      "start": 158,
      "end": 429
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L1",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-22 08:48:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Update",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L2",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-22 08:48:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 22,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L3",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-22 08:48:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "- **To:** Dorian Pike (Maintenance Operations Lead, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 158
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L5",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-22 08:48:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "NBL-016 is pending review.",
      "start": 160,
      "end": 186
    }
  ]
}
